{"format":"telly-addicts-eps","v":1,"show":"Softly, Softly: Task Force","i":55459,"eps":[{"s":1,"e":1,"t":"Arrival","a":"1969-11-20","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460601.jpg","d":"Things are about to change at Thamesford Constabulary when Detective Chief Superintendent Charles Barlow arrives to take over as new head of CID. Barlow's orders are to whip Thamesford Constabulary into shape and to ensure that operations run smoothly. He soon finds that it's going to be a major job to get the constabulary into shape as duties have been neglected."},{"s":1,"e":2,"t":"Exercise","a":"1969-11-27","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460350.jpg","d":"Detective Chief Superitendent Barlow is in for a surprise as Chief Constable Cullen has some considerable staff changes in mind for Thamesford CID. Cullen wants to provide Charlie Barlow with the best team to assist him in setting up a highly efficient task force. However, soon the stabbing of a woman takes priority over personnel matters at Thamesford CID."},{"s":1,"e":3,"t":"Diversion","a":"1969-12-04","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460351.jpg","d":"While the task force officers are busy investigating a series of break-ins, an armed hold-up at a timber warehouse requires immediate attention and quick action. Will Thamesford CID be able to catch the robbers and still have time to deal with the burglaries? It's up to Detective Inspector Harry Hawkins and his fellow officers to prove to their superiors how efficient the task force team can work."},{"s":1,"e":4,"t":"The Spoilt Ones","a":"1969-12-11","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460352.jpg","d":"Career criminal Sid Stannish is in the frame for a series of minor break-ins, but would he really risk a further conviction for the sake of such minor hauls?"},{"s":1,"e":5,"t":"To Protect the Innocent","a":"1969-12-18","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460597.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":6,"t":"Any Other Night","a":"1970-01-01","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460598.jpg","d":"It's New Year's Eve, the last day of 1969. While Chief Constable Cullen desperately tries to get all four division chiefs of Thamesford Constabulary to bury their hatchets and make them get along with each other despite their animosity, a van load of tires worth several hundred pounds is stolen from the police compound. It's back to duty for the partying CID task force team."},{"s":1,"e":7,"t":"The Aggro Boy","a":"1970-01-08","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460604.jpg","d":"Two young boys get into trouble at a football match. Barlow, Watt and the Task Force try to protect them from the consequences of their actions."},{"s":1,"e":8,"t":"Standing Orders","a":"1970-01-15","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460648.jpg","d":"While on the lookout for an escaped prisoner, PC Snow gets involved in a strike at a local factory. As the strike becomes more aggressive, task force members move in and try to de-escalate. Soon DI Harry Hawkins finds trouble heading his way when he inadvertently steps on the toes of a contractor who doesn't appreciate that Hawkins insists to act in accordance with the law."},{"s":1,"e":9,"t":"Private Mischief","a":"1970-01-22","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460649.jpg","d":"A worried barman asks John Watt why a detective constable is asking questions about him. Watt makes some alarming discoveries about the constable in question."},{"s":1,"e":10,"t":"Open and Shut","a":"1970-01-29","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460650.jpg","d":"A case of domestic disturbance turns into murder, and Chief Superintendent Barlow thinks he has an open and shut case on his hands. But soon Charlie Barlow has to admit to himself that he has been wrong, and it tales all his and the CID team's skills to solve this puzzling case."},{"s":1,"e":11,"t":"Sprats and Mackerels","a":"1970-02-05","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460651.jpg","d":"A rumor causes Thamesford task force to investigate at Eastcote docks where someone allegedly brings illegal immigrants into the country. WP/DC Betty Donald goes undercover, posing as a juvenile delinquent, while Sergeant Jackson receives an undercover assignment at a nearby camping site."},{"s":1,"e":12,"t":"Like Any Other Friday...","a":"1970-02-12","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460653.jpg","d":"Barlow is pursuing the hint of an armed robbery. Hawkins and Jackson are tackling another in a series of Thursday night thefts. But there is something different about this particular Friday."},{"s":1,"e":13,"t":"Power of the Press","a":"1970-02-19","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460654.jpg","d":"Chief Constable Cullen sees the need to seek the assistance of the press."},{"s":1,"e":14,"t":"Trust a Woman","a":"1970-02-26","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460655.jpg","d":"While investigating the case of a missing Swedish au pair, WP/DC Betty Donald comes across some information about local criminal Christopher Connor who seems to be plotting a crime. As it turns out, Connor and three accomplices plan to rob a jeweler's store. But Superintendent Watt doesn't trust Betty Donald's informer and smells a rat."},{"s":1,"e":15,"t":"The Hermit","a":"1970-03-05","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460657.jpg","d":"Barlow and Watt are on the look-out for a reclusive individual to assist them with their inquiries into a diabolical crime."},{"s":1,"e":16,"t":"Escort","a":"1970-03-12","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460658.jpg","d":"A senator from the United States is about to visit Oldcote Parish Church, and it's a Task Force job to see that he is protected and nothing untoward is going to happen. It's a job that is not to be taken lightly because the senator has been receiving threats for quite some time. Someone seems to be out to kill him."},{"s":2,"e":1,"t":"Baptism","a":"1970-09-16","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460950.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":2,"t":"Sunday, Sweet Sunday","a":"1970-09-23","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460951.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":3,"t":"Safe in the Streets?","a":"1970-09-30","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460952.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":4,"t":"Good Listener","a":"1970-10-07","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460954.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":5,"t":"Time Expired","a":"1970-10-14","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460956.jpg","d":"When Sergeant Jackson spots ex-convict Ingram, the task force suspect the recently released former prisoner is trying to located a loot of stolen bullion which had been hidden at an unknown location just before Ingram and his soon-to-be-released partner in crime Thompson were arrested. There's a lot of hard, dirty and arduous work to be done, but it's not the task force members who sweat over it."},{"s":2,"e":6,"t":"Lessons","a":"1970-10-21","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460957.jpg","d":"Chief Superintendent Charlie Barlow is having himself a ball lecturing crime investigation officers how to proceed when investigating a murder case. But things soon turn nasty when the body of a teenage girl is found on the beach. Barlow and his team are forced to deal with the prime suspect, a window cleaner, and a grief-stricken father."},{"s":2,"e":7,"t":"Without Favour","a":"1970-10-28","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460960.jpg","d":"While investigating a series of thefts Sergeant Evans steps on the toes of a shady landlord who allegedly employs some enforcers to collect rent due from his tenants. Evans gets into trouble with his superiors when he decides to take matters in his own capable hands and pays the landlord a visit for a friendly chat and a warning."},{"s":2,"e":8,"t":"Never Hit a Lady","a":"1970-11-04","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460988.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":9,"t":"Its Ugly Head","a":"1970-11-11","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460989.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":10,"t":"Who Wants Pride...?","a":"1970-11-18","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460990.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":11,"t":"Collation","a":"1970-11-25","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460991.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":12,"t":"Do Me a Favour","a":"1970-12-02","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460992.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":13,"t":"Sweet Are the Uses of Adversity","a":"1970-12-09","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460994.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":14,"t":"Bearings","a":"1970-12-16","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460995.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":15,"t":"A World Full of Rooms","a":"1970-12-23","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460996.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":16,"t":"The Lie Direct","a":"1970-12-30","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460997.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":17,"t":"Ground Level","a":"1971-01-06","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1460998.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":18,"t":"Company Business","a":"1971-01-13","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1461000.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":19,"t":"Kick Off","a":"1971-01-20","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1461002.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":20,"t":"Final Score","a":"1971-01-27","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1461004.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":21,"t":"Something Big","a":"1971-02-03","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1461005.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":22,"t":"Games","a":"1971-02-10","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1461006.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":23,"t":"In the Public Gaze","a":"1971-02-17","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1461303.jpg","d":"Chief Constable Cullen gets a taste of the action when he witnesses a police officer getting severely beaten. Coming to the young constable's aide, Cullen soon faces a dilemma as one of the culprits makes allegations against the Chief Constable."},{"s":2,"e":24,"t":"Held for Questioning","a":"1971-02-24","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1461304.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":25,"t":"Black Equals White","a":"1971-03-03","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1461305.jpg"},{"s":2,"e":26,"t":"Cash and Carry","a":"1971-03-10","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1461306.jpg"},{"s":3,"e":1,"t":"Once Bitten","a":"1971-10-06","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1461825.jpg"},{"s":3,"e":2,"t":"Hostage","a":"1971-10-13","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1461830.jpg"},{"s":3,"e":3,"t":"The Floater","a":"1971-10-20","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/584/1461831.jpg"},{"s":3,"e":4,"t":"Aberration","a":"1971-10-27","l":60,"img":"h